Cycle 1/8 passed: My earliest memory wasn't really mine.
Cycle 2/8 passed: It belonged to the people who brought me home.
Cycle 3/8 passed: They told me about the Sanctuary. About my First Breath, and the five pairs of hands waiting to hold me.
Cycle 4/8 passed: In every telling, someone remembered a different thing: the sound I made, or the way I gripped a finger and wouldn't let go.
Cycle 5/8 passed: I used to ask them to tell it again. They always began with the joy of it.
Cycle 6/8 passed: Only later did I wonder how nervous they'd been. They'd brought Kael home before me, but did that make it any easier?
Cycle 7/8 passed: Lumen, the child of Aurora and Nyx, was still a young world when I was born.
Cycle 8/8 passed: My own parents were Maia, Arin, Selene, Dorian, and Sage.
